==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|drepa|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtrɛːpa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ɛːpa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|drap|drápu|drepið}}

# {{ambitransitive|with accusative|lang=is}} to [[beat]], [[hit]]
# {{ambitransitive|with accusative|lang=is}} to [[kill]]
#: ''Ég '''drap''' hestinn.''
#:: I '''killed''' the horse.
# {{ambitransitive|with dative|lang=is}} to [[dip]]
#: ''Að '''drepa''' fingri í lækinn.''
#:: To '''dip''' a finger in the brook.

