===Verb===
{{head|non|verb}}, [[drep]]; [[drap]], [[drápu]]; [[drepinn]]

# to [[beat]], to [[hit]], to [[push]], to [[knock]]
# to [[kill]], to [[slay]]
# to [[capture]] (''e.g. in chess'')

